Package: connect-dual-spark
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Connect Dual Spark contributors <connect-dual-spark@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), gnome-terminal, iproute2, ethtool, openssh-client, sudo, curl, rsync, git, xdg-utils
Description: configure two DGX Spark systems for Unsloth Studio
 Discovers a direct ConnectX-7 link, prepares llama.cpp RPC on the
 second DGX Spark, and configures Unsloth Studio to use that link.
